WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.680
OROPO'S TOWER

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:04.280
Flopin?

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.280
Flopin!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.040
I'm right here, Mama. Mama!

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.120
I'm over here.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:57.640
I noticed something really weird about
these things. Watch what they do.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.680
-My cuts have disappeared.
-That's not all.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.840
I've spent hours checking our cell.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.280
It's open,
but there's no way to escape

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:11.320
and the walls are slippery,
so you can't grip them.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:21.560
You're right, there's no way to escape,
anywhere.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:28.720
At least for now.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.480
-We're going to find a way out of here.
-Sure you will!

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.400
&lt;i&gt;That is, if I leave you enough time.&lt;/i&gt;

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:41.040
Mama, it's that crazy lady's voice,
the Sram who attacked us!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.280
&lt;i&gt;Toxine!&lt;/i&gt;

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.200
Don't let your guard down. We'll...

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.360
Fall!

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.320
We're finally here.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.240
I don't understand.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:33.240
I can't feel anything.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:39.400
These plants have no signs of life.

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:42.920
We'll pick flowers later.
There's a pretty girl to rescue!

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:47.560
And an annoying brother, too!
Best of all, there's a fight to be had!

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.320
Elely, hold on!

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:10.040
Well, it didn't take us very long
to fall into a trap.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.920
It's a temporal bubble. We need
to move fast before they find us.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.720
We're too vulnerable like this.
Let's go to the entrance.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.560
I can barely move.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.720
I don't feel good.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.520
My strength is leaving me.

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:12.880
Elely! You're... growing up!

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:15.520
And you're... getting old.

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:17.880
Rubi!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.120
Don't ask me for help.
I'm in the same boat.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:27.800
Oh, no!

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:35.320
I am suddenly feeling
a bit older than usual, my friends.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.880
No, anything but my teeth.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:50.240
It's funny how the tables can turn.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:53.200
Like when an arrogant mommy
is able to keep quiet

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:55.840
once I promise her a nice long fall.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.040
It'll be okay, darling.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:05.920
"It'll be okay, darling"?

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.120
If there was ever a time
to be worried, it's now!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.560
Okay, it's time for the final challenge.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:18.280
I'll stand up when I finish speaking.
If you let your mother go, you will live.

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:21.400
If you keep holding her hand,
you'll fall with her.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.920
Choose your fate!

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:27.320
Take care of your dad and sister.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:31.680
I'll take care of you too, Mama.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:36.800
Yuck! All this mushy stuff
makes me feel sick.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:38.240
So long, suckers!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:46.680
Oh, wow! The brat didn't let go.
That's one brave kid!

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:07.880
Toxine!
What did I tell you about this place?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.760
That we need to redecorate?

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:15.720
You're not... allowed...

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:18.080
...in here ever!

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.560
That's right!
I must have got the wrong door!

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.760
You won't be warned a second time.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:38.360
Thank you for saving our lives.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:42.880
You're welcome, Flopin.
I'm sorry about what just happened.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:46.360
You are my guests
and I will allow nobody to hurt you.

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:50.000
Toxine has her uses,
but she won't bother you anymore.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:53.240
You must be Dame Echo. I've heard of you.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:56.920
Adamai thought highly of you,
then he betrayed his friends.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:00.320
We are all free to make our own choices,
Evangelyne.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:04.000
And before you begin thinking badly
of my brotherhood,

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:08.120
-I'd like the chance to show you around.
-To show us around our cell?

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:13.160
I'm sure you'll agree
it's quite welcoming, as prisons go.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:40.720
The front door...

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.960
We have to reach the front door.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.880
&lt;i&gt;Quite right, Yugo,&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;but are you strong enough?&lt;/i&gt;

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:50.400
&lt;i&gt;And your friends,&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;how are you possibly going to save them?&lt;/i&gt;

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:53.560
That voice... I know it.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:57.520
&lt;i&gt;I'm flattered, Yugo! You still remember me&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;after all these years.&lt;/i&gt;

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:58.680
Nox!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:04.400
&lt;i&gt;You have to admit the kid has&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;a good memory, Noxy. Runs in the family.&lt;/i&gt;

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:06.040
Qilby?

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.960
&lt;i&gt;Calm down, little brother,&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;you know this place.&lt;/i&gt;

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:13.520
&lt;i&gt;In fact, you know it very well,&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;a place where time has no effect.&lt;/i&gt;

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:16.200
&lt;i&gt;A place where sleep, hunger,&lt;/i&gt;

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:19.840
&lt;i&gt;boredom, joy and sadness&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;mean nothing at all.&lt;/i&gt;

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:22.840
&lt;i&gt;This lifeless place&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;where you imprisoned me.&lt;/i&gt;

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:25.160
&lt;i&gt;It's worse than dying, isn't it, Noxy?&lt;/i&gt;

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:28.280
&lt;i&gt;No idea, I've only tried one of the two.&lt;/i&gt;

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:29.400
Show yourselves!

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:32.080
Show yourselves!

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:35.200
Full of fight, as ever, little Eliatrope.

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:41.920
He wouldn't have beaten us
if he was any different.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:46.640
No! You... You can't be here,
you're supposed to be dead!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.080
You have to go on, Elely.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:05.240
Go... Go and find your mother!

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:08.120
-Which one?
-Huh?

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.360
Which one?

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.000
You don't want to answer?

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:23.160
Why won't you answer my question, Papa?

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.280
Sweetheart...

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.120
Which mom do you want me to find?

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.200
What?
I don't understand what you're saying.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:32.800
You don't understand,
or you pretend not to?

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:36.920
Our daughter is right, Dally.
Don't pretend to be such an Iopbrain.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:41.680
-Evangelyne!
-Well, which mom is she supposed to save?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.360
Great Iop god,
how many wives and children have you had

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:47.800
in all of your glorious reincarnations?

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:51.160
Yeah, that's an excellent question
for my old man.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:54.040
I can't say
you were there for me as a child.

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:58.240
I guess you must have been busy,
what with being the god of fighting.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:01.640
-But if that's true...
-You shouldn't have had children.

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:05.200
Flopin...

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:07.520
How many wives, Dally?

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.920
-How many little girls were there, Papa?
-How many little boys?

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:17.040
I don't know... I don't know.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:33.680
Well, Ruel, old buddy, it looks like
this time is really the end for you.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:42.200
Huh? It's...it's.. it's ka... ka... kamas?

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.120
It's kamas! It's kamas!

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:57.600
It's kamas! Thousands of kamas!
Millions of kamas!

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.640
That's right, my love. They're your kamas.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:07.000
And when I say your kamas, what
I should really say is our kamas, right?

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:19.640
Arpagone?

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:26.160
Are you happy to see me again, Ruel?

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.720
But you... you can't be here!

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:32.560
-You can't!
-Yes, I know.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:34.400
I disappeared because of you.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:38.960
But you left because it...
Well, because it was cheaper.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.480
Because of you, Ruel.
You always preferred money to your wife.

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:52.920
&lt;i&gt;But it's never too late to change things.&lt;/i&gt;

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.080
Huh? Who is that?

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:01.080
&lt;i&gt;I can help you, Ruel Stroud.&lt;/i&gt;

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:23.880
&lt;i&gt;No, you haven't aged a day, Amalia.&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;Your divine beauty can never be tarnished.&lt;/i&gt;

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.360
I know what's bothering you, Princess.

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:38.040
You're afraid of losing me.

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:43.880
And you no longer feel at home
in your own kingdom.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:48.200
You never behaved as a Sadida princess
should. You know that already.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:49.240
Armand?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:54.200
You spent more time having fun with
friends than taking care of your subjects.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:57.320
The Brotherhood of the Tofu
saved the Sadida Kingdom.

00:14:57.400 --> 00:15:01.040
Your little gang's put the kingdom
in danger more often.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.680
You fought using toys
too powerful for you.

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.320
The Eliacube, the Dofus...

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.560
It's a miracle your games
didn't damage the world more.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.480
Stop it!

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:13.000
Now you leave your dying father
to go on another adventure.

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:16.560
Is your mission so important,
little sister?

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:22.200
It was you, Father.
It was you who told me to go.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:40.320
Stay calm, child. I mean you no harm.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:55.880
Thank you. But can you do the same
for my dad and my friends now, please?

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:57.920
It's not that simple, Elely.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:03.240
You dirty traitor!
Where are my mom and brother?

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.080
Like father, like daughter.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.120
-Let go!
-Are you sure you know what you're doing?

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:20.040
Certain. Her soul is so pure
that I am unable to get into her mind.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.080
She'll make a perfect Iop goddess.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:26.080
Iop goddess? That's the second time
someone's mentioned that.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.720
Why do you think I came looking
for you and your brother?

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:39.120
It doesn't bother you
knowing you had other wives?

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:41.400
Do you think you deserve to be a hero?

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:43.440
No.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.400
You don't care
that you had other little girls?

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.040
And other little boys?

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.760
-That you weren't there to raise them?
-Yes.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.360
Yes.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.520
I can fix this, Percedal of Sadlygrove.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.200
All you need to do is take my hand.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:09.160
What you don't seem to understand,
Yugo, is that...

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:11.600
All three of us share a strong link.

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.480
-You, me...
-And me!

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:18.480
Our only purpose was to find the rest
of our family and live in peace.

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:21.480
Except you two
would stop at nothing to find them.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:24.200
You were both prepared
to destroy the world.

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:29.240
And you would stop at nothing to prevent
us from doing so. I died because of you.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:34.200
I'm locked up in this place
because of you.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.840
-You, too.
-You're capable of anything.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:42.120
Even committing heinous acts
just to save your world.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:44.200
I know, but you left me no choice.

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:46.720
You always have a choice, Yugo.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:49.400
What if you could change what you did?

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:51.760
What if you could make a deal?

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:56.560
My name is Oropo
and I know you better than anyone, Yugo.

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:58.720
Will you accept my help?

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:22.320
Papa!

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.560
My dear Brotherhood of the Tofu.

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:35.040
The most important battles are
the ones we win against ourselves.

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:40.760
You came here
looking only to cause chaos,

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:45.440
without even understanding the importance
of what our brotherhood is preparing.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.600
You are so sure
that you are the heroes of this world

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:53.720
that you no longer see your flaws.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.440
Adamai understood that a few years ago.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.000
Ad...

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.880
Brother,
I was searching for you for months.

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:27.160
Don't touch my dad!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:33.720
Brother, I feel we're not giving
our future goddess a very good impression.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:41.480
I despise violence, Elely, and that's why
I want you to join us to put a stop to it.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:45.640
With your help,
we can create a better world.

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:49.960
By attacking families, kidnapping children

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.480
and leaving their dad
for dead in a ravine?

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:55.280
You can't change the world
without sacrifices.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:59.200
But I don't want to force you.
I'd rather you decide on your own.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.120
We will take the place of the gods,

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:07.000
who couldn't care less for their children,
or for the worlds they brought to life.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.640
I want you to join us, Elely.
I want you to do so of your own accord.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:20.360
There are a dozen levels
in my tower of dreams.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.480
Each level belongs to a future god.

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:27.440
Meet them. Compare your hopes
and beliefs with theirs.

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:32.000
I promised I would help all of you
and I will.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:35.240
-Ad...
-I will therefore promise you

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:38.720
everything you want,
if you accept my guardians' challenges

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:42.400
and want the same things
once you reach the top of my tower.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.560
Our future Iop goddess believes in you.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.960
Will you accept my deal,
Brotherhood of the Tofu?

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:52.200
We accept!

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:58.840
Perfect. Then let's go, brother, and leave
our new friends to do as they see fit.

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:12.200
Well, then,
that could have been worse, right?

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:24.400
I don't understand, Oropo.

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:27.800
Why not just get rid of them right away?

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:31.680
I've entered their minds, Adamai.
They're already defeated.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:34.920
Climbing the tower will be
just slow agony for them,

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:38.600
but it will reinforce the beliefs
of each of our future gods.

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:42.120
I know them. You're still running a risk.

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:47.640
What risk, brother? Seeing as you have
the six Eliatrope Dofus and I have...

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.520
...the Eliacube.

